            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "laitment"
            },
            "reviewBody": "If you want to avoid the extra sugar from the orange juice concentrate, use orange extract.\n\nIt's a pretty standard milkshake recipe, so I don't think you can legitimately say that the texture is bad.\n\nBefore you recommend playing with the amount of milk, do keep in mind that \"scoops\" of ice cream is a very arbitrary measurement. Try starting with a 2:1 ratio of ice cream to milk.",
            "datePublished": "2007-07-02T12:28:17.107Z"
          },
          {
